              <outline text="知识点：未标注" />
              <outline text="答案：D" />
              <outline text="解析提炼：主要用例由系统中描述标准系统行为的标准事件流组成；主要用例代表用例的正常、预期和成功完成" />
            </outline>
            <outline text="Q55. The primary use case consists of a standard flow of （1） in the system that describes a ..." _question_id="491775">
              <outline text="知识点：未标注" />
